  "goodToKnow": "Die Ethnologie is ethnology or cultural anthropology, formerly called Völkerkunde; der Ethnologe is an ethnologist. Many collections in German ethnological museums come from the colonial era, and in 2022 Germany began returning Benin Bronzes to Nigeria. Berlin's Humboldt Forum, displaying such collections, has been controversial. Volkskunde, by contrast, studied one's own folk culture. It has no plural."
